  "lore": {
    "summary": "Seventy metres of long tables serving the whole strip in three sittings, and the one building on it where rank is treated as a suggestion. Everybody who makes a Frame eats here, and so does anybody who wants to be told the truth about how the work is actually going.",
    "playerFacing": "Steam, a very long counter, and a noise level that makes a private conversation easier rather than harder. Somebody will move up to make room without being asked and will then ask who you are, in that order.",
